### name: plan.identity-barrier.retains-safe-prefix.mariadb
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"R":{"kind":"relation","from":"r","fields":{"CAT":{"kind":"column","column":"cat","type":"TEXT"}}}}
--- source
R .> TAKE(2) .> MAP(RECORD("key", _["cat"] + 0)) .> BUCKET(_["key"], RECORD("key", _K, "n", COUNT(_)))
--- plan
hybrid
--- tables
r
--- expect
SELECT * FROM `r` LIMIT 2
===

